#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:5
#: 6b4f250e1f684dcabc1b496b7fa31918
msgid "3DR Solo - ArduCopter Master Upgrade"
msgstr "3DR Solo - ArduCopter Master 升级"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:7
#: a8bc1ea57e7f46aca9040dbc5b747624
msgid ""
"This article details upgrading and operating ArduCopter version 3.5.0 and"
" higher a 3DR Solo."
msgstr "本文详细介绍了如何在 3DR Solo 上升级并使用 ArduCopter 3.5.0 及更高版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:10
#: 06846d59838c4c5e880a09e02cc0e773
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:11
#: 406f18e8ee4a4e499dd9331d2f9c4517
msgid ""
"The 3DR Solo contains, among many things, a Pixhawk 2.0 autopilot. It "
"comes with a heavily customized branch of an early ArduCopter 3.3 "
"compiled specifically for the Solo by 3DR. When you do the initial pre-"
"flight update on a new Solo (or after a factory reset), part of that "
"update is this Solo  branch of ArduCopter. It is installed on the "
"Pixhawk, and has all the necessary default parameters and customizations "
"baked into it. It is essentially transparent to the user, taking place "
"behind the curtains.  Since 3DR is no longer in the consumer UAS "
"business, this custom branch of ArduCopter will not be seeing any further"
" updates. It was last updated in early 2016, and is now very far behind."
msgstr ""
"3DR Solo 内置了众多组件，其中包括一个 Pixhawk 2.0 飞控。它出厂时搭载了一个由 3DR 专门为 Solo "
"编译的、经过大量定制的早期 ArduCopter 3.3 分支版本。当您对新 Solo "
"进行首次飞行前更新（或出厂重置后），此次更新的一部分就是这个 Solo 专用的 ArduCopter 分支，它被安装在 Pixhawk "
"上，并内置了所有必要的默认参数和定制配置，对用户来说基本是透明的，在幕后运行。由于 3DR 已退出消费级无人机市场，这个定制的 "
"ArduCopter 分支将不再有任何更新。它最后一次更新是在 2016 年初，目前已大幅落后于主线版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:14
#: ee058617cdc54c828f59ee2264dcb249
msgid "Life After 3DR"
msgstr "3DR 之后的新生"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:15
#: 9c0a1d312dbb45e693e6d816ad946f61
msgid ""
"Since the Solo uses a Pixhawk autopilot, it is capable of running "
"variations of ArduCopter besides the 3DR customized Solo version. This "
"article will focus on installing, configuring, and operating ArduCopter "
"version 3.5.0 or higher on a 3DR Solo. ArduCopter continues where 3DR "
"left off, keeping the Solo a modern, advanced, and highly capable sUAS.  "
"There are countless advances in the autopilot firmware making it a more "
"stable, reliable, and agile aircraft. There are many new features such as"
" boat mode, RTK GPS, enhanced telemetry, ADS-B, lidar laser altimeters, "
"terrain awareness and following, IR precision landing, and even and "
"\"indoor GPS\"."
msgstr ""
"由于 Solo 使用的是 Pixhawk 飞控，因此它能够运行除 3DR 定制 Solo 版本之外的其他 ArduCopter "
"变体。本文将重点介绍如何在 3DR Solo 上安装、配置和使用 ArduCopter 3.5.0 或更高版本。ArduCopter 在 3DR "
"停止支持后继续发展，使 Solo "
"保持现代化、先进且高度可用的小型无人机状态。飞控固件有无数改进，使飞行更加稳定、可靠且灵活。还增加了许多新功能，如船只模式、RTK "
"GPS、增强型数传、ADS-B、激光雷达测距仪、地形感知与跟随、红外精确降落，甚至还有\"室内 GPS\"功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:27
#: 7c4f3dec212b469481182e75e2c01d94
msgid ""
"*Photos by Andrew Emmett, Matt Lawrence, Stephan Schindewolf, & Paul "
"Dinardi*"
msgstr "*照片由 Andrew Emmett、Matt Lawrence、Stephan Schindewolf 和 Paul Dinardi 提供*"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:32
#: ef7d6e86a5da4e5f8f239f393dbbe80d
msgid "Hardware Requirements"
msgstr "硬件要求"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:33
#: b9cf75ca00ba4bf4bd460218ed52e894
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk 2.1 (CubePilot CubeGreen/CubeBlack) (or a traditional Cube "
"with the internal jumper set for 5 volts) is currently required for safe "
"and reliable use of ArduCopter 3.5.0 and higher on a 3DR Solo. You can "
"purchase the Green Cube from `Jesters Drones "
"<http://www.jestersdrones.org/store/index.php?rt=product/category&path=68>`_"
" or directly from  `CubePilot <https://www.cubepilot.com>`_.  The Cube "
"has significantly more advanced components.  This includes 3 temperature "
"controlled IMUs and the 5 volt signalling the Solo needs to operate "
"safely. If you already have a Cube, you can set an internal solder jumper"
" to 5 volt signalling and use it in your Solo.  The Green Cube comes with"
" this jumper pre-set for 5 volts."
msgstr ""
"目前，在 3DR Solo 上安全可靠地使用 ArduCopter 3.5.0 及更高版本需要 Pixhawk 2.1 Green "
"Cube（或内部跳线设置为 5 伏的传统 Cube）。您可以从 `Jesters Drones "
"<http://www.jestersdrones.org/store/index.php?rt=product/category&path=68>`_"
" 或直接从 `ProfiCNC <http://www.proficnc.com/3dr-solo-accessories/79-the-"
"cube.html>`_ 购买 Green Cube。The Cube 拥有更加先进的硬件组件，包括 3 个温控 IMU 以及 Solo "
"安全运行所需的 5 伏信号。如果您已有 Cube，可以将内部焊接跳线设置为 5 伏信号后用于 Solo。Green Cube 出厂时已预设此跳线为"
" 5 伏。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:40
#: ab67efbfd9f842c7adac4779f2b895e4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You *can* install ArduCopter master on the stock Pixhawk 2.0, but it is "
"highly discouraged. It will install, and it will fly.  But you are at "
"fairly high risk for motors shutting down in flight, leading to a serious"
" crash. This is because of an electrical hardware flaw in the Solo's "
"motor pods.  The old stock firmware has a software patch to *mostly* "
"mitigate this flaw. This is what you may hear referred to as \"slew rate "
"protection\". You can view the code for the slew rate protection in the "
"stock 3DR firmware `here on their GitHub site "
"<https://github.com/3drobotics/ardupilot-"
"solo/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.cpp#L388>`_.  The "
"production versions of ArduCopter, including ArduCopter 3.5 do not have "
"this slew rate protection. It is severely handicapping and difficult to "
"manage for a world of vehicles that use ArduCopter besides the Solo.  The"
" 5 volt signalling used in the Pixhawk 2.1 (CubePilot "
"CubeGreen/CubeBlack) effectively solves the electrical problem on the "
"motor pods."
msgstr ""
"您*可以*在原装 Pixhawk 2.0 上安装 ArduCopter "
"master，但强烈不建议这样做。它可以安装并飞行，但电机在飞行中意外关闭导致严重坠机的风险相当高。这是由于 Solo "
"电机舱存在电气硬件缺陷。原装固件通过软件补丁*基本上*缓解了这一缺陷，也就是您可能听说过的\"斜率保护（slew rate "
"protection）\"。您可以在 `这里的 3DR GitHub 站点 <https://github.com/3drobotics"
"/ardupilot-"
"solo/blob/master/libraries/AP_Motors/AP_MotorsMatrix.cpp#L388>`_ 上查看原装 "
"3DR 固件中斜率保护的代码。包括 ArduCopter 3.5 在内的 ArduCopter 量产版本均不包含此斜率保护，因为它对于使用 "
"ArduCopter 的众多其他飞行器来说过于限制且难以管理。Pixhawk 2.1 Green Cube 使用的 5 "
"伏信号从根本上解决了电机舱的电气问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:42
#: 4fa41ca30d404196ac99449c5e42b332
msgid ""
"There are other potential ways to mitigate the electrical problem with "
"the motor pods without buying a new Cube.  You could use conventional DIY"
" ESCs and bypass the ones built into the motor pods.  Or you could build "
"a level converter that steps the signalling voltage up from 3v to 5v.  "
"None of these solutions are commercially available as a kit, but can be "
"done on a DIY basis if you are creative. You would not have the benefit "
"of enhanced hardware in The Cube, but it would be just as safe and "
"reliable to fly."
msgstr ""
"还有其他一些在不购买新 Cube 的情况下缓解电机舱电气问题的方法。您可以使用普通 DIY ESC 并绕过电机舱内置的 "
"ESC，或者制作一个将信号电压从 3V 升压到 5V "
"的电平转换器。这些方案目前没有商业化的套件可购买，但如果您有创意，可以自己动手实现。虽然您无法享受 The Cube "
"增强硬件带来的好处，但飞行的安全性和可靠性与之相当。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:44
#: 7bedfcd7b72b417aa345af27c5078697
msgid ""
"You cannot use the old stock 3DR Solo firmware on the Cube. It is "
"entirely incompatible. This also means you cannot do a factory reset on "
"the Solo with The Cube still in the Solo. The factory reset tries to "
"reload the old Solo firmware, which is incompatible.  If you need to "
"Factory Reset, you will need to put the old stock Pixhawk 2.0 back in, "
"run the full factory reset and update, then put the Green Cube back in. "
"This is annoying, but there is no way around it now or in the foreseeable"
" future. In short, do not need to factory reset. Which also means do not "
"lose your WiFi password!  Do not throw away your old stock cube!"
msgstr ""
"您无法在 Cube 上使用原装 3DR Solo 固件，两者完全不兼容。这也意味着在 Solo 中装有 The Cube "
"的情况下无法进行出厂重置，因为出厂重置会尝试重新加载与之不兼容的旧 Solo 固件。如果需要出厂重置，您需要先将原装 Pixhawk 2.0 "
"装回，完整执行出厂重置和更新，然后再将 Green Cube "
"装回。这很麻烦，但目前及可预见的将来都没有解决办法。简而言之，尽量避免需要出厂重置的情况，也就是说不要忘记 WiFi 密码！不要丢弃您的原装 "
"Cube！"

