msgstr "无失控保护动作"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:164
#: 3ef63a530dcc42b9a1dea58639afa950
msgid "Land immediately, no RTH/RTM. Useful for indoors."
msgstr "立即就地降落，不执行 RTH/RTM。适用于室内飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:165
#: 8c905d30ca474880906ecdde52c759eb
msgid "RTH/RTM"
msgstr "RTH/RTM"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:169
#: c744d7b8b05447e1800d9740f741759c
msgid ""
"FS_BATT_VOLTAGE is the low battery voltage threshold for Copter-3.5 (and "
"earlier). For Copter-3.6 (and higher) check the :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter. When the battery voltage drops below this "
"point, the low battery beeper sounds and it will do what you have "
"``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` set for. This value is expressed in volts. The default"
" is 14.0. You can adjust this higher or lower depending on use case and "
"preference."
msgstr ""
"FS_BATT_VOLTAGE 是 Copter-3.5（及更早版本）的低电压阈值。对于 Copter-3.6（及更高版本），请查看 "
":ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 参数。当电池电压低于此值时，低电量蜂鸣器将响起，并执行 "
"``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` 中设定的动作。此值以伏特为单位，默认值为 14.0。您可以根据使用场景和偏好调整此值的高低。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:173
#: 11f490c695de455c9057ead13a6b3fb4
msgid "No low voltage alarm or failsafe"
msgstr "无低电压报警或失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:174
#: 7cb2722d26874b4c88c09e5fed48604a
msgid "14"
msgstr "14"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:174
#: 3e67b5fb5bf040feba76b84f20084397
msgid "14 volts"
msgstr "14 伏"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:179
#: d2615529050c4e5db23e52f706aa3630
msgid ""
"FS_BATT_MAH is the battery capacity remaining threshold expressed in "
"milliamperes (MAH) for Copter-3.5 (and earlier). For Copter-3.6 (and "
"higher) check the :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter. When the"
" battery remaining capacity drops below this point, the low battery "
"beeper sounds and it will do what you have ``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` set for. "
"The default is 520. On the solo, that is on average about 1.5 minutes of "
"flying time remaining. You can adjust this up or down to fit your "
"preference and use case. Setting it for 0 will disable capacity remaining"
" based alarms and failsafes."
msgstr ""
"FS_BATT_MAH 是 Copter-3.5（及更早版本）以毫安时（MAH）表示的剩余电池容量阈值。对于 "
"Copter-3.6（及更高版本），请查看 :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` "
"参数。当剩余电池容量低于此值时，低电量蜂鸣器将响起，并执行 ``FS_BATT_ENABLE`` 中设定的动作。默认值为 520，在 Solo "
"上平均约相当于 1.5 分钟的飞行时间。您可以根据偏好和使用场景调整此值。设置为 0 将禁用基于剩余容量的报警和失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:183
#: 8a4fba13b4f443e4b882f46356c4efe7
msgid "No battery capacity remaining alarm or failsafe"
msgstr "无剩余电池容量报警或失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:184
#: 690c111624794625b7faf8c33ad523de
msgid "520"
msgstr "520"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:184
#: 96a79afe0e3a47888aee74a5a705da6e
msgid "520 MAH"
msgstr "520 MAH"

