#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:210
#: eff88aaf6b8b435799edfdd08d56ac46
msgid ""
":ref:`AHRS_GPS_USE <AHRS_GPS_USE>` is for enabling or disabling the GPS "
"on you Solo. The default is 1 for enabled. The primary use case for "
"disabling the GPS is for indoor flight. If the GPS is disabled, it cannot"
" and will not try to use it for flight, failsafes, or any other function."
" That means RTH mode is not available. You must be familiar with how the "
"failsafes work without a GPS. In most cases, the Solo will land since it "
"cannot RTH."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AHRS_GPS_USE <AHRS_GPS_USE>` 用于启用或禁用 Solo 的 GPS。默认值为 1（启用）。禁用 GPS "
"的主要使用场景是室内飞行。如果禁用 GPS，飞控将不会尝试将其用于飞行、失控保护或任何其他功能，这意味着 RTH 模式不可用。您必须熟悉在没有 "
"GPS 情况下失控保护的工作方式，在大多数情况下，由于无法执行 RTH，Solo 将就地降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:214
#: ac3471194b584e51adfb0548652ad869
msgid "GPS disabled"
msgstr "GPS 禁用"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:215
#: db94a87c20514d7bb7ea29f9b12295a4
msgid "GPS enabled"
msgstr "GPS 启用"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:219
#: d5ad9c9dbbc3472d9b4cc7578eafc50b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` enables and disables dataflash "
"(\\*.bin) logging when the Solo is disarmed.  It is currently enabled by "
"default since it can be very useful for testing and troubleshooting. But "
"it does result in large and often unnecessary logs.  If you are "
"comfortable and confident in your Solo, you disable logging while "
"disarmed.  The dataflash logs be much cleaner and volumnous."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_DISARMED <LOG_DISARMED>` 用于启用或禁用 Solo 上锁时的 "
"dataflash（\\*.bin）日志记录。由于对测试和故障排查非常有用，目前默认启用。但这会产生大量且通常不必要的日志。如果您对 Solo "
"的状态感到满意和有信心，可以禁用上锁状态下的日志记录，这样 dataflash 日志将更加简洁和精简。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:223
#: f8a5c412df154890ac4e59bbf69e912b
msgid "Disabled / No dataflash logging while disarmed"
msgstr "禁用 / 上锁时不记录 dataflash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:224
#: 46f56c76215a4d0082023ea86d674758
msgid "Enabled / Dataflash logging while disarmed and armed."
msgstr "启用 / 上锁和解锁时均记录 dataflash 日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo_arducopter_upgrade.rst:229
#: 72027d1b748a4e6491ea60dce85d98b2
msgid "Further Information"
msgstr "更多信息"

